    <title>Vol.162 【越洋串台】阿默VS老周：逛公园才是正经事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b0176f31a0c5c4465ed50aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b0176f31a0c5c4465ed50aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:40:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿默  电台主播 &amp; 神兽之间联合创始人老周  上岸市集主理人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期BAC独立阅读节上阿默（神兽之间联合创始人）与老周（上岸市集主理人）的公园主题对谈实录</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=00:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></span><span> 越洋主播电台腔限定时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a>由神兽之间玉湖公园书店（11月30日结业）切入，聊聊公园在生活中的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a>作为杭州土著的老周vs作为小镇青年的阿默谈谈对公园的不同初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>现在的公园是动词和形容词：古朴野趣的老式公园、植入商业业态的新式公园都是不同的容器</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=16:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a></span></span><span> 闹中取静的“城市充电宝”和日新月异的浦江两岸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a>现在是参与公园商业的好时机吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=37:22"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a></span></span><span> 公园作为一种旅行认知：日本的城市公园vs英国的郊野公园</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=42:03"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">42:03</a></span></span><span> 公园的创造性实验：落叶圣诞树</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=46:15"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">46:15</a></span></span><span> 杭州听众们分享的各个公园</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:江上青山JasonYama-日日好日子  蜀の毎日 (SiChuandaily)布皮树-一瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【互动方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博@越洋电话bot</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：overseascall7</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/网易云电台/喜马拉雅/Spotify/Apple Podcasts：搜索“越洋电话On Call”</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，您也可以</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/oncall" data-url="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/oncall"><img src="https://img.buymeacoffee.com/button-api/?text=Buy me a coffee&amp;emoji=☕&amp;slug=oncall&amp;button_colour=FFDD00&amp;font_colour=000000&amp;font_family=Poppins&amp;outline_colour=000000&amp;coffee_colour=ffffff"></a></p>]]></description>
