  <item>
    <title>Vol161.【越洋电台特辑】我可真为我的音乐品味着迷并落泪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad4f3d951558d1e2be6ed0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad4f3d951558d1e2be6ed0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:26:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>满堂 &amp; 阿默 &amp; Jojo &amp; River</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期内容】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=00:00"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></span><span> 越洋主播电台腔限定时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=04:28"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a></span></span><span> 听不懂闽南语的阿默推荐的闽南语歌曲-FunkyMo《门》，顺便推荐郑钧《门》</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=16:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a></span></span><span> 湖南观众周周callin推荐的宝藏老歌-万芳《温哥华悲伤一号》，顺便推荐陈升《一个人去旅行》</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=30:26"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a></span></span><span> 因为River儿子喜欢而推荐的铿锵老歌-莫文蔚《妇女新知》</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=38:51"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a></span></span><span> 满堂为了单纯欣赏而欣赏的画面感音乐-青葉市子"COLORATURA"</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=46:08"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a></span></span><span> 单纯听音乐而什么都不干是不是一种奢侈</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=52:26"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3146">52:26</a></span></span><span> 精神哪吒阿默推荐-小河"寻谣计划"之《打水歌》，以及平等地讨厌所有洗脑童年歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=64:25"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3865">64:25</a></span></span><span> 宁古塔文学爱好者River推荐-苏联电影插曲《飞扬的秋千》和《最美好的前途》，以及相信孩子可以理解复杂的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=75:45"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4545">75:45</a></span></span><span> 周周被《春光乍泄》大银幕画面冲击而推荐的墨西哥悲伤民谣-Caetano Veloso "Cucurrucucu Paloma"</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=92:38"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5558">92:38</a></span></span><span> 满堂推荐《科隆女孩》的电影原声及现场录音专辑-Keith Jarrett "The Köln Concert"（1975）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【互动方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微博@越洋电话bot</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：overseascall7</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/网易云电台/喜马拉雅/Spotify/Apple Podcasts：搜索“越洋电话On Call”</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，您也可以</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/oncall" data-url="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/oncall"><img src="https://img.buymeacoffee.com/button-api/?text=Buy me a coffee&amp;emoji=☕&amp;slug=oncall&amp;button_colour=FFDD00&amp;font_colour=000000&amp;font_family=Poppins&amp;outline_colour=000000&amp;coffee_colour=ffffff"></a></p>]]></description>
