  <item>
    <title>Vol.149 中年危机？中年应激？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a26102697e115babe96df18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a26102697e115babe96df18</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:34:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>极繁少女      阿默</span><br><span>老gay灵魂    Jojo</span><br><span>步子迈得比心快的  River</span><br><span>给每个新人三次机会的 满堂</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:08"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a></span></span><span> 四十惑不惑？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=06:36"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a></span></span><span> 冷知识：下班后在车里坐一阵子再回家不是中年男人的专利</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=08:59"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="539">08:59</a></span></span><span> “退行性病变”就是你的身体不会再年轻的意思</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=13:14"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a></span></span><span> 2026年中年男子的第一危机点仍然是事业</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=18:29"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a></span></span><span> 很多危机的褶皱都是靠消费和昂贵的爱好来抚平的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=21:19"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a></span></span><span> 按计划活到了有自己的三口之家，但我的心还在爸妈的家里怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=38:02"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">38:02</a></span></span><span> 儿子的头发竟然成了中年母亲的危机</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=44:55"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a></span></span><span> 还记得年少时的梦吗，到了中年发现都是痴</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=48:12"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a></span></span><span> 41岁被公司裁员，突然发现人就是可以什么都不做</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=55:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a></span></span><span> 我的事业格局如同我的衣橱：越堆越多，无处收纳</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:01:28"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3688">01:01:28</a></span></span><span> 是因为中年吗？我已经不爱出去玩耍了</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:08:05"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4085">01:08:05</a></span></span><span> 你信？ 人年纪上来了，还是有点好处的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:12:55"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4375">01:12:55</a></span></span><span> 25岁的自己，我还是有点羡慕你的</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=01:18:01"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4681">01:18:01</a></span></span><span> 中年危机能平安度过的话，还有更动人心魄的老年危机呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>PMS BLUES by Dolly Parton</span></p><span></span><p><span>《苦瓜》by 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@越洋电话bot</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：overseascall7</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果podcast：进入资料库，点击右上角“编辑”，选择“通过URL添加节目”，复制节目rssfeed </span><a href="https://oncall.typlog.io/episodes/feed.xml" data-url="https://oncall.typlog.io/episodes/feed.xml"><span>https://oncall.typlog.io/episodes/feed.xml</span></a><span> 点击“订阅”</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/网易云电台/喜马拉雅：搜索“越洋电话”</span></p><span></span><p></p>]]></description>
